# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# PinBridge .gitignore
# 约定：仓库只提交"可重建"的源码、文档、配置；一切产物、样本、轨迹、密钥都不进版本库。
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Rust -----------------------------------------------------------------
/target/
**/target/
*.rs.bk
*.pdb
*.exp
*.lib
*.obj
*.ilk
*.rlib
*.rmeta
# 编译产物类型的 dll/exe 只在 out/ 下出现（见下）
[cC]argo.lock.bak

# --- C/C++ (Pin tool 与 C ABI 层) ----------------------------------------
*.o
*.a
*.so
*.so.*
*.dylib
*.exp
/out/
/build/
cmake-build-*/
# native 层的构建目录（CMake Ninja 产物 + 编译期自检目标）。
# 注意 `native/build/` 不是 `/native/build/`：无论谁在哪个上层目录构建，
# 产物都不该入库。同时这里也排除了测试夹具复制过来的 agent DLL。
native/build/

# --- Python ---------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
.venv/
venv/
htmlcov/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
coverage.xml
dist/
wheels/

# --- Node / Tauri / React -------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
pnpm-lock.yaml.bak
apps/desktop/dist/
apps/desktop/src-tauri/target/
apps/desktop/src-tauri/gen/
.DS_Store

# --- IDE / 编辑器 ---------------------------------------------------------
.vs/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/launch.json
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# --- PinBridge 运行期产物 -------------------------------------------------
# 轨迹文件可能包含目标程序内存快照/字符串，绝不入库
*.pbt
*.pbt.zst
.traces/
traces/
logs/
*.log
# 会话与活动记录
.hub/
.pinbridge/
# 内嵌 Python 脚本缓存
*.pyc.script

# --- 样本与授权材料（法律边界：永不入库）---------------------------------
samples/
!samples/README.md
fixtures/private/
*.vmp
*.vmprotect
# 加密狗 / 授权文件
*.lic
*.key

# --- 密钥与本地配置 -------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.pfx
credentials.json
secrets.toml

# --- 第三方 (Pin 本体与 SDK 不入库，见 third_party/pin/README.md) ---------
third_party/pin/*
!third_party/pin/README.md
!third_party/pin/.gitkeep
